-in storage and direct access to the modern, renovated main bathroom. The unit also includes in-suite laundry, an attached storage shed and a private outdoor patio. The parking stall is right in front of the unit, making unloading groceries a breeze, and Gariepy Park is just behind the building, with open green space, community league amenities, playgrounds and Centennial School. Pet-friendly complex! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$170,000"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Style","Bungalow, Carriage"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","894 sq ft"],["Lot size","2,030 sq ft"],["Year built","1978"],["Storeys","1"],["Condo fee","$388 monthly"],["2026 City assessment","$180,000"],["Est. property tax","about $1,870/year ($156/month)"],["Neighbourhood","Gariepy"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6M1B4"],["MLS® number","E4517076"],["Listed","November 20, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Parking","Stall"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.92 m × 3.48 m (16'2\" × 11'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.78 m × 2.68 m (9'1\" × 8'10\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.04 m × 2.66 m (10'0\" × 8'9\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.35 m × 3.14 m (14'3\" × 10'4\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.09 m × 2.81 m (10'2\" × 9'3\")"],["Pantry","Main level","1.48 m × 1.29 m (4'10\" × 4'3\")"],["Storage","Main level","2.73 m × 1.12 m (8'11\" × 3'8\")"]],"courtesy":"Brad Bosker, Schmidt Realty Group Inc","tax_m":156,"tax_note":{"year":2026,"per_k":"10.36","city":"Edmonton","licence":"City of Edmonton open data, licensed under the Open Government Licence – City of Edmonton","estimator":"https://taxestimator.edmonton.ca/"},"board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"gariepy","area":"west-edmonton"}